{"id":"visio_n","lemma":"visión","pos":"noun","rank":1351,"glosses":["vision (something seen; an object perceived visually)","vision, sight (the sense or ability of sight)","view (a way of understanding something, an opinion, a theory)"],"ipa":"/biˈsjon/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"visiones"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/bc/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-visi%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"He tenido una visión.","en":"I had a vision.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/550372","words":[{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"Acabo de tener una visión.","en":"I just had a vision.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/448440","words":[{"g":"synonym of acabamiento"},{"g":"of / from"},{"g":"to have"},{"g":"a"},null]},{"text":"En nuestros días ya nadie cree en visiones.","en":"Nowadays no one believes in ghosts.","words":[{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"our, ours, to us","l":"nuestro"},{"g":"day","l":"día"},{"g":"now"},{"g":"no one"},{"g":"to believe","l":"creer"},{"g":"in / on"},null]},{"text":"Perdí la visión en un ojo.","en":"I lost sight in one eye.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/819264","words":[{"g":"to lose","l":"perder"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"a"},{"g":"eye"}]},{"text":"La nieve dificultaba la visión.","en":"The snow was making it hard to see.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/419375","words":[{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"snow"},null,{"g":"the / her"},null]}]}